ADDITIONAL NOTICE, SPECIFIC TO THIS SOFTWARE

This software models solid rocket motors, including chamber pressure and the
wall thickness required to contain it. People use tools like this to decide
what to build and then build it.

The "AS IS" and "NO WARRANTY" terms above are not boilerplate here. Read
MODEL_UNCERTAINTY.md before relying on any number this produces: several of its
models are approximations with measured errors, at least two are uncalibrated,
and the uncertainties it reports are a floor on the error rather than a bound.

Verify independently. Test remotely. Assume the model is wrong.
